{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a63292f37bef16a2", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# Omni-Captioner: Data Pipeline, Models, and Benchmark for Omni Detailed Perception\narXiv: 2510.12720\nAuthors: Ziyang Ma, Ruiyang Xu, Zhenghao Xing, Yunfei Chu, Yuxuan Wang, Jinzheng He, Jin Xu, Pheng-Ann Heng, Kai Yu, Junyang Lin, Eng Siong Chng, Xie Chen\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: audio_understanding\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. Identification of the \"co-growth\" phenomenon where increased detail in omni language models inherently accompanies increased hallucination.\n  2. Proposal of Omni-Detective, an agentic data generation pipeline that uses iterative tool-calling to produce highly detailed yet minimally hallucinatory multimodal captions.\n  3. Development of Audio-Captioner and Omni-Captioner, trained via a two-stage curriculum to achieve state-of-the-art audio and audio-visual detailed perception.\n  4. Introduction of Omni-Cloze, a novel cloze-style benchmark for stable, efficient, and reliable evaluation of audio, visual, and audio-visual detailed captioning.\n\nTags: LALM, LALM/理解型, Eval, Eval/听觉感知", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "80e239b2-8a28-4502-9952-dd42607093ae", "uuid": "452e33b9-7610-49a2-a402-1dd049ecea88", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T08:38:03.780Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# Omni-Captioner: Data Pipeline, Models, and Benchmark for Omni Detailed Perception\narXiv: 2510.12720\nAuthors: Ziyang Ma, Ruiyang Xu, Zhenghao Xing, Yunfei Chu, Yuxuan Wang, Jinzheng He, Jin Xu, Pheng-Ann Heng, Kai Yu, Junyang Lin, Eng Siong Chng, Xie Chen\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: audio_understanding\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. Identification of the \"co-growth\" phenomenon where increased detail in omni language models inherently accompanies increased hallucination.\n  2. Proposal of Omni-Detective, an agentic data generation pipeline that uses iterative tool-calling to produce highly detailed yet minimally hallucinatory multimodal captions.\n  3. Development of Audio-Captioner and Omni-Captioner, trained via a two-stage curriculum to achieve state-of-the-art audio and audio-visual detailed perception.\n  4. Introduction of Omni-Cloze, a novel cloze-style benchmark for stable, efficient, and reliable evaluation of audio, visual, and audio-visual detailed captioning.\n\nTags: LALM, LALM/理解型, Eval, Eval/听觉感知", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
